GR2 / Granny reader - @carbonenginejs/runtime
=============================================

A pure-JavaScript reader for RAD Game Tools' Granny 3D (.gr2) file format,
under `src/resource/formats/gr2`.
Contains no RAD/Granny code and does not link granny2.dll. Section decompression
is reimplemented from clean-room / open reverse-engineering efforts, listed below.

CarbonEngineJS-facing code is copyright cppctamber / CarbonEngineJS
contributors. CarbonEngine source material, formats, class names, and schema
semantics remain copyright their original CarbonEngine authors.
Fenris Creations (CCP Games) source material, tools, assets, shader behavior,
and EVE-related data remain copyright their original holders.

Current repository license: MIT. See LICENSE.

This reader was migrated from the former `carbonenginejs/format-gr2` package
into `@carbonenginejs/runtime`; that repository now only forwards here. Paths
below are the reader's CURRENT locations, so every claim can be checked against
the file it names.

BitKnit/BitKnit2 is RAD Game Tools' compression format, used by Granny. The
format and its algorithm are RAD's. Only the decoder source in this package is
CarbonEngineJS's: on 2026-07-24 it replaced a former EUPL-derived decoder with
a clean-room implementation written solely from a facts-only format
specification (docs/resource/formats/bitknit2.md). No EUPL-derived code
remains.

